 "calls": {
  "_about": "A call = an app recording from the microphone (CoreAudio, checked every 5 s; the audio itself is never touched). While on a call the time counts as Meetings whatever window is in front, and as active for up to no_input_ok.minutes without keyboard or mouse. Only known call apps count (CALL_APPS in activity_tracker.py: Zoom, WhatsApp, FaceTime, phone, Teams, Slack, ...), and a browser only while a meeting tab (Meet, Zoom, Teams, Slack, WhatsApp Web) is open, so dictation (Wispr Flow) and voice input on a web page are never meetings. not_a_call = mic users that never count even so, matched on bundle id or its prefix; any other mic user is logged once in tracker.log.",
  "not_a_call": [
   "com.electron.wispr-flow",
   "com.superduper.superwhisper",
   "com.apple.SpeechRecognitionCore",
   "com.apple.assistantd",
   "com.apple.corespeechd",
   "com.apple.Siri",
